### 复用 WikiContext

现有的 `runtime/src/wiki/mod.rs` 中的 `load_wiki_context` 可以复用：

```rust
pub fn load_wiki_context(workdir: &Path) -> Result<WikiContext> {
    let mut store = MemoryStore::new(workdir);
    store.load()?;
    
    // 用户级
    let user_entries = store.list_by_scope(MemoryScope::User);
    let user_summary = format_entries(user_entries, MAX_SECTION_LEN);
    
    // 项目级
    let project_entries = store.list_by_scope(MemoryScope::Project);
    let project_summary = format_entries(project_entries, MAX_SECTION_LEN);
    
    Ok(WikiContext {
        user_summary: Some(user_summary),
        project_summary: Some(project_summary),
        session_summary: None, // 从 session 目录加载
    })
}
```

### 命令行兼容

保留现有的 `/memory` 命令，底层使用新的 MemoryStore：

```rust
pub fn render_memory(workdir: &Path, args: &[String]) -> Result<String> {
    let mut store = MemoryStore::new(workdir);
    store.load()?;
    
    match args.first().map(|value| value.as_str()) {
        Some("path") => render_paths(&store),
        None | Some("show") => Ok(render_show(&store)),
        Some("summary") => Ok(render_summary(&store)),
        Some("search") => render_search(args, &store),
        Some("append") => render_append(args, &mut store),
        _ => Ok(usage_text()),
    }
}
```

